  {
    "_comment": "DATAQUALITY · Operators beyond plain Enrich + Summary: Enrich(to_table) and Summary(custom table) derived tables, Filter and Select (Filter removes the rows its criteria selects, redirecting them to to_table; Select copies them), a non-triggering Fail, a multi-classifier and a multi-column action, a multi-operator chain, and include_quality_columns carrying verdict columns into the output. Every test is a pub->tfr->sub chain over dq_src (DataGenSrc) / dq_ops (@transformer with on_tables=[DataQuality]) / dq_sink (TrashDest): the transformer passes its input through and carries the data-quality action under test, the server applies it to the output tables (rewriting in place and/or registering derived tables), and the subscriber asserts each resulting table matches its authored expected frame (see functions/_harness.py). Generated by gen_suites.py."
